OL,3,GNEWSAOwner charged #700 over lost dog's
OL,4,Amissing records
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog owner has been ordered to pay
OL,7,Fnearly #700 for failing to ensure her
OL,8,Flost dog could be traced back to her.
OL,10,FAllison Prudence Collin, 61, of Short
OL,11,FStreet, Ludgershall, was found guilty
OL,12,Fof failing to ensure a dog wore a
OL,13,Fcollar displaying the owner's name and
OL,14,Faddress and failing to comply with a
OL,15,Fformal notice requiring the dog's
OL,16,Fmicrochip details to be updated.
OL,18,FIt follows an incident in April 2026,
OL,19,Fwhen a terrier-type dog named Cookie
OL,20,Fwas found wandering through the Short
OL,21,FStreet area without an owner present.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
