OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Salisbury Magistrates' Court on
OL,7,FTuesday, Collin, who did not attend the
OL,8,Fhearing, was fined #220 and ordered to
OL,9,Fpay #389.21 in costs and a #88 victim
OL,10,Fsurcharge.
